Hits the target with your weapon, doing [43%, 48%, 53%, 56%, 60% (TL1-5)] damage. If the attack hits, the target is stunned for [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns and has their bleed resistance reduced by 50%.

The stun chance increases with your Physical Power.

''It may not bleed, exactly, but you'll make it hurt.''
